# SDD-L11-T8. Third-party libraries vendored into the repo, marked so GitHub Linguist stops
# counting them as this project's code.
#
# They are 265,737 of the 279,602 bytes of JavaScript left after the L11 migration — 95% of it —
# so without this the language bar reports ~21% JavaScript for a codebase whose own remaining
# JavaScript is 13,865 bytes (eslint.config.mjs and four jest config files, the documented D2
# exception). Marking them is not cosmetic bookkeeping: the alternative is a headline number that
# describes Raphaël's authors rather than this repository.
#
# This matches how the project already treats them everywhere else — `sonar-project.properties`
# and `.deepsource.toml` both exclude `lighthouse/assets/**` as "vendored Raphael and Treant, not
# our code to analyze". Neither file is ours to maintain or migrate.
#
# Raphaël 2.1.4 — © 2008-2012 Dmitry Baranovskiy / Sencha Labs, MIT.
# Treant-js — © Fran Peručić, MIT.
lighthouse/assets/raphael.js linguist-vendored
lighthouse/assets/Treant.js linguist-vendored
